    rdfs:comment "Brought into force Sec 1,2,3,4,5,10,22,23,24,25,26,27,28,29,30,139,146,164 of the CGST Act w.e.f. 22.06.2017."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Notification 01/2017-CT"@en .
